            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>To smoothly and reliably control the rotational operation of a tip operation part 18 in a manipulator for microscopic work 10. The manipulator 10 includes a tip operation part 18 configured to execute a handling operation of a work object or an instrument for work, a link mechanism 13 configured to change a position and an orientation of the tip operation part 18 in a space in which the work object is present, and a support part 17 between the link mechanism 13 and the tip operation part 18. The support part 17 includes a first drive mechanism 19 configured to drive the tip operation part 18 to generate the handling operation and a second drive mechanism 17 configured to rotate the tip operation part 18 around a predetermined rotational axis. Not only the second drive mechanism 17 but also the link mechanism 13 is configured to rotate the tip operation part 18 around the predetermined rotational axis. The rotation of the tip operation part 18 is performed in a first angle range by the link mechanism 13 and in a second angle range by the second drive mechanism 17. A size of the first angle range is different from that of the second angle range, and the first angle range is smaller than the second angle range.</p>
            </abstract>
